e poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/b1c426d81911fb36c7e9006b248c8a20.poster.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/b1c426d81911fb36c7e9006b248c8a20.webm?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/b1c426d81911fb36c7e9006b248c8a20.mp4?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Playable in either flatscreen or in VR!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Welcome to J\u00fcngle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/b2722fec6d611d87178297eb2f56e28036788f6c.jpg"},{"name":"On the Clock","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/9b38933fb7e23099d077a81ac1caafaf58c9c2b9.jpg"},{"name":"Home sweet home.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/43aa5b46d3d4316dcade654c14af4ec1438b24ed.jpg"},{"name":"Race Complete","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/d2e12cf401bdb9fbf31441bbf04775fc3b1a7c83.jpg"},{"name":"Try me","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/6d905a271ce44912dc900076b6bd1de1eda70bad.jpg"},{"name":"Where does this lead?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/cbc39c946ed6aa5a047750e3c22fc0cd566bdb8f.jpg"},{"name":"Old Junk","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/b9fad042d8c93f6bf7fdeca446b36d5a9fd25fa8.jpg"},{"name":"Rats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/872c5122620760a1edac325002583a49cc1a68bf.jpg"},{"name":"Mommy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/268325e9c3d61f512e40425c7127ed3f09369a32.jpg"},{"name":"Takedown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1579280/b60e292ef981c1990803ba2369847d9968ad270a.jpg"}],"total":31},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1579280?t=1765980987","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765980987","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765980987","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765980987","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST MEOW! \ud83d\ude3b</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><br>The Last Worker is an immersive narrative adventure centered around a lone worker\u2019s last stand in an increasingly automated world, with a unique blend of work simulation and stealth strategic gameplay. <br><br>The game is set in a lonely, oppressive but strangely beautiful environment, with characters designed by comics legend Mick McMahon.<br><br>Kurt works for the world\u2019s largest retailer and is forced to choose between capitalism or activism. Having dedicated his life to work, Kurt\u2019s loyalty is put to the test when a group of activists ask him to dismantle J\u00fcngle from the inside.<br><br>Aboard his corporate issued flying J\u00fcnglePod and armed with his multi-purpose J\u00fcngleGun, Kurt dispatches countless products from a fulfilment centre the size of the sunken city of Manhattan.<br><br>Kurt (voiced by \u00d3lafur Darri \u00d3lafsson) has dedicated his life to J\u00fcngle, with only his co-bot, Skew (Jason Isaacs) to keep him company. But when S.P.E.A.R., a group of activists, asks Kurt to help dismantle J\u00fcngle from the inside, Kurt is forced to discover his employer\u2019s dark underbelly.<br><br>The Last Worker delivers an emotional, thought provoking and inspiring story with rich characters performed by an all-star cast starring, Jason Isaacs, \u00d3lafur Darri \u00d3lafsson, Clare-Hope Ashitey, David Hewlett, Zelda Williams and Tommie Earl Jenkins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/1c1fb30d6df94e71adcd30469dc2a943.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Hand-painted 3D characters and environments based on concepts by comics legend Mick McMahon (Judge Dredd, 2000 AD)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/2d19a28b52d5d1a0f347abc322cad3a8.poster.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/2d19a28b52d5d1a0f347abc322cad3a8.webm?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/2d19a28b52d5d1a0f347abc322cad3a8.mp4?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/d4e8a9c537c01df7faac200119d777cd.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Hours of narrative, immersive gameplay in a giant hand-crafted environment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/32b7ab4910c066cf10df819a9b217f48.poster.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/32b7ab4910c066cf10df819a9b217f48.webm?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/32b7ab4910c066cf10df819a9b217f48.mp4?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/1a11aa7feed2a986b725e230030aa52d.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>A story worthy of the big screen - A collaboration between writer/director J\u00f6rg Tittel (The White King, Ricky Rouse Has a Gun) and VR pioneers Wolf &amp; Wood (A Chair in a Room: Greenwater, The Exorcist: Legion, Hotel R\u2019n\u2019R).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/0a60817b817f3f409ff51a277d890df0.poster.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/0a60817b817f3f409ff51a277d890df0.webm?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/0a60817b817f3f409ff51a277d890df0.mp4?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/023c5fe02a4a370756a8cd8dc457fedf.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Rich characters performed by an all-star cast in a story filled with heartfelt drama, biting satire and intense action. <br>Starring \u00d3lafur Darri \u00d3lafsson, Jason Isaacs, Clare-Hope Ashitey, David Hewlett, Zelda Williams and Tommie Earl Jenkins.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/a8efe7a21dba1e29030e6d70925d6fee.poster.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/a8efe7a21dba1e29030e6d70925d6fee.webm?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/a8efe7a21dba1e29030e6d70925d6fee.mp4?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/f50ba5bdb0290c734961a52be908dfea.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=80 /></span><br>Composed by Oliver Kraus (Sia, Adele, Florence and the Machine), with vocals by classical music star Jakub J\u00f3zef Orli\u0144ski<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/b1c426d81911fb36c7e9006b248c8a20.poster.avif?t=1765980987\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/b1c426d81911fb36c7e9006b248c8a20.webm?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1579280/extras/b1c426d81911fb36c7e9006b248c8a20.mp4?t=1765980987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Playable in either flatscreen or in VR!","developers":["Oiffy","Wolf & Wood Interactive Ltd"],"dlc":[2351000],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shar